= A definite integral

Consider the classic

$ integral_0^1 x^2 dif x = 1 / 3. $

And an inline sum $sum_(k=1)^n k = n(n+1) / 2$ for good measure.

$ mat(1, 0; 0, 1) dot vec(a, b) = vec(a, b) $
